00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:12.300
this Fellow Scholar asked it to choose&nbsp;
from Ronaldo and Messi in the style of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:18.660
Jesse Pinkman from Breaking Bad. Who is the&nbsp;
