00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:24.120
the answer to you, but you know what?&nbsp;
We can even have a different learning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:44.100
algorithm clone the actor’s voice and use&nbsp;
it to answer himself. How cool is that?

